Package: ruleatlas
Type: Package
Title: Syntactic Sport and Game Rules
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(given = "TODO", family = "MAINTAINER", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Provides native validation of sport and game states, permitted moves
    and observed events, deterministic rule consequences, and outcome calculation.
    Includes 212 profiles with explicit variant scopes and a bounded declarative
    interpreter for versioned user-defined rules. Does not simulate physical
    movement, generate strategies, or estimate winning probabilities.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite, stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: no
